<div class="sat-reflection">
  <h4>Activity 22: Comparison of Platforms</h4>
  <div class="sat-reflection__item">
    <label>What is the most important characteristic of a platform to consider when choosing a tool to solve this problem?</label>
    <textarea rows="3" placeholder="Type your answer here..."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="sat-reflection__item">
    <label>How can the platform and sensor chosen impact the tools chosen to identify or manage the pest?</label>
    <textarea rows="3" placeholder="Type your answer here..."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="sat-reflection__item">
    <label>How could a farmer save money, time, and labor by using drones, satellites, or rovers?</label>
    <textarea rows="3" placeholder="Type your answer here..."></textarea>
  </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
  .sat-reflection {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin: 30px 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }
  .sat-reflection h4 {
    color: var(--isu-red);
    font-size: 1.2em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-family: Georgia, Garamond, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  }
  .sat-reflection__item {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .sat-reflection__item label {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .sat-reflection__item textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 12px;
    font-family: Georgia, Garamond, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    resize: vertical;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
</style>